# Route: guide 40 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 57 to
# 58, 48 quests, 2.5 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Undercity, Western Plaguelands, Eastern Plaguelands, Orgrimmar,
# Winterspring, Blasted Lands, Thousand Needles): Undercity -> near Undercity
# -> Undercity -> near Undercity -> Undercity -> Felstone Field -> Dalson's
# Tears -> Ruins of Andorhal -> The Writhing Haunt -> Thondroril River ->
# Ruins of Andorhal -> The Marris Stead -> Darrowshire -> ….
#
# Optional (elite: grouping up is advised): The Star, the Hand and the Heart
# (736; Grel'borg the Miser 39, Dagun the Ravenous 43, Mogh the Undying 44);
# The Crimson Courier (6145; Crimson Courier 60); The Scarlet Oracle, Demetria
# (6148; Demetria 61).
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category); dungeon quests (the
# Dungeons guides): The Book of Ur (1013), The Book of Ur (1013), Going,
# Going, Guano! (1109), Going, Going, Guano! (1109), Bring the End (3341), The
# Power to Destroy... (5725), Light's Justice (92421), Light's Justice
# (92421), The New Plague (95216), Source of Power (96988), Doctor Theolen
# Krastinov, the Butcher (5382), Kirtonos the Herald (5384), The Lich, Ras
# Frostwhisper (5466), Krastinov's Bag of Horrors (5515), Of Love and Family
# (5848), Oculus Illusions (6569), Dawn's Gambit (4771), The Flesh Does Not
# Lie (5212), The Active Agent (5213), The Great Fras Siabi (5214), Houses of
# the Holy (5243), The Archivist (5251), Above and Beyond (5263), The Restless
# Souls (5282), Menethil's Gift (5463), Plagued Hatchlings (5529), Ramstein
# (6163), Dead Man's Plea (8945), Anthion's Old Friend (8948), Necklace
# Recovery, Take 2 (2284), Rig Wars (2841), Rig Wars (2841), The Royal Rescue
